      "name": "Anime Subtitles Kazakh — ikymory",
      "description": "1,400 release entries and 9,786 usable subtitle tracks. Kazakh anime subtitle archive with machine-translated tracks, download manifests and a read-only JSON API. Translation accuracy, human review and complete-series coverage are not verified. Release entries are not distinct anime; track counts do not establish complete episode or series coverage. Metadata and episode numbering remain unverified. No video or audio is hosted.",
